    "Paused apps count too; short sounds don’t." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → Fine-Tuning, Detection, under the ways of detecting playing apps: how “Any app with sound on” works (an app with its sound on counts even when paused; a sound shorter than 2 seconds doesn't pause the player)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تُحتسب التطبيقات المتوقفة مؤقتًا أيضًا، أما الأصوات القصيرة فلا."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les apps en pausa també compten; els sons curts, no."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Počítají se i pozastavené aplikace; krátké zvuky ne."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apps på pause tæller også; korte lyde tæller ikke."
          }
        },
