    "Where the notch or other apps’ icons can’t hide it. Turned off, ⌘‑drag it where you like." : {
      "comment" : "Settings → General, under Keep icon next to system icons; ⌘-drag is how macOS moves menu bar icons",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
